        "text": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "This release of Zilliz Cloud introduces several key updates: the ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Notebook Gallery",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": true,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": ", which provides examples on advanced features like RAG, embeddings, and multi-modal search; an ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Improved Capacity of Performance-optimized CU",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": true,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": ", now increased by 50%, accommodating up to 1.5 million 768-dim vectors per CU and potentially reducing costs by 30% for large data volumes; and ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Multi-replica Availability",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": true,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": ", enhancing query performance and reliability by distributing workloads and replicas across Availability Zones (AZs). Additionally, Zilliz Cloud now supports the ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "AWS Tokyo Region",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": true,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": " for improved performance in the Asia-Pacific area, ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Prometheus Integration",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": true,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": " for real-time monitoring and troubleshooting, and a revamped ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "Authentication and Login System with Auth0",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": true,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": ", offering multiple login methods including SSO. Lastly, users can evaluate Zilliz products through the ",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": "AWS Marketplace Free Trial",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": true,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "text_run": {
                "content": ", providing risk-free access to core features for performance and scalability testing.",
                "text_element_style": {
                  "bold": false,
                  "inline_code": false,
                  "italic": false,
                  "strikethrough": false,
                  "underline": false
                }
              }
            }
          ],
